"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 57, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["好的，这段5秒钟的视频展现了一个非常柔美且具有亲和力的画面。为了方便你进行图生视频（Image-to-Video）的创作，我将从画面内容、动作细节、视觉风格以及具体的提示词（Prompts）四个方面进行详细描述。\n\n### 1. 画面内容描述 (Scene Description)\n\n*   **主体人物：** 一位年轻漂亮的亚洲女性，皮肤白皙，妆容精致（带有柔光感）。她穿着一件白色的碎褶吊带背心，显得清纯而优雅。佩戴着细致的金饰（项链和手链）。\n*   **环境背景：** 室内卧室场景。背景是柔和的米白色床头和浅褐色的窗帘，整体色调偏暖，营造出一种温馨、私密且舒适的氛围。\n*   **构图：** 中近景镜头，人物位于画面中心，略微俯视的角度，增强了与观众的互动感和亲近感。\n\n### 2. 动作细节描述 (Action Breakdown)\n\n*   **发型变化：** 视频开始时，她用右手抓着头发束在脑后，随后轻轻松开手，长发如丝绸般自然垂落在肩膀两侧。\n*   **面部表情：** 随着头发落下，她露出了甜美、略带羞涩的微笑。眼神温柔地注视着镜头。\n*   **结束动作：** 在视频末尾，她轻轻地将食指放在唇边，做了一个“嘘”或者俏皮的暗示动作，增加了画面的灵动感。\n*   **动态感：** 头发的飘动非常自然，带有轻微的慢动作感，身体有细微的晃动，整体动作流畅且连贯。\n\n### 3. 视觉风格 (Visual Style)\n\n*   **光影：** 采用柔光照明，减少了面部的阴影，使皮肤看起来极其平滑细腻（类似美颜滤镜效果）。\n*   **色调：** 高调（High-key）画面，以白色和米色为主，给人一种干净、明亮的感觉。\n*   **画质：** 高清，具有电影感的浅景深效果，背景略微虚化，使人物更加突出。\n\n---\n\n### 4. 图生视频提示词 (Prompts for AI Video Generation)\n\n你可以根据你使用的工具（如 Runway Gen-2, Luma Dream Machine, Kling 可灵, Pika 等）选择以下提示词。建议使用英文，因为目前主流模型对英文的理解更精准。\n\n#### 选项 A：侧重于动作描述（通用型）\n> **Prompt:** A beautiful young Asian woman in a white ruffled camisole sitting on a bed. She starts by holding her long dark hair up with her hand, then releases it so it flows down naturally over her shoulders. She looks into the camera with a sweet, gentle smile and ends by placing a finger on her lips in a playful gesture. Soft bedroom lighting, cinematic, high quality, 4k, fluid motion, realistic hair physics.\n\n#### 选项 B：侧重于氛围与画质（写实型）\n> **Prompt:** Photorealistic video of a girl releasing her hair. Close-up shot, soft warm indoor lighting. Her long black hair falls smoothly. Elegant white outfit, delicate jewelry. She smiles warmly at the viewer. Soft bokeh background, 8k resolution, highly detailed skin texture, slow motion, graceful movements.\n\n#### 选项 C：针对“可灵/Luma”等强动态模型（指令型）\n> **Prompt:** The woman releases her hair held by her hand, letting it fall naturally. She then smiles sweetly and puts her index finger to her lips. The camera remains steady. Natural hair movement, high fidelity, masterpiece, soft aesthetic.\n\n---\n\n**建议操作技巧：**\n1.  **首帧参考：** 如果你使用的是“图生视频”功能，请务必上传视频开头的截图作为参考图。\n2.  **运动幅度控制：** 如果工具支持（如 Runway 的 Motion Brush 或 Pika 的 -motion 参数），可以给头发和面部表情设置中等强度的运动数值（4-6），以保持动作的自然。\n3.  **负向提示词 (Negative Prompt)：** 如果支持，可以加入 `distorted face, messy hair, blurry, low quality, unnatural movement` 以提升生成质量。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 62, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [413.668701171875, 738.5361938476562], "pos": [239.6998291015625, 204.29954528808594], "id": 60, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 4}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "groupNodes": {"视频信息": {"external": [[8, 0, "STRING"]], "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [210, 194.5454559326172], "pos": [-1050, 0], "widgets_values": ["这是一个10秒的视频"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "index": 0, "id": -1, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "图片", "